# 2026-10-19 [version 0.1.0]
## New Features
  - Add KV APIs (set/add/replace, append/prepend, gets, incr/decr, touch/get-and-touch, delete, bulk)
  - Add List APIs (create, insert, get, delete, get-and-delete, bulk, piped insert)
  - Add Set APIs (create, insert, exist, get, delete, get-and-delete, bulk, piped insert/exist)
  - Add Map APIs (create, insert, upsert, update, get, delete, get-and-delete, bulk, piped insert/update)
  - Add B+Tree APIs (create, insert/upsert with trimmed result, update, incr/decr, get, delete, get-and-delete, count, find position, get by position, smget, bulk, piped insert/update)
  - Add item attribute get/set APIs
  - Add cache flush API (all or by prefix, with delay)
  - Add Arcus health indicator and liveness/readiness probes
  - Add OpenAPI docs and Swagger UI
  - Add Docker Compose quick start
